				<a href="#kogane">
				<img src="img/kumokore010_small.jpg" width="146" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/kumokore/img/kumokore010.jpg" --></a></td><td>
